{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And you shall stumble</b> — concerning the high priest who was in the days of this prophet; he speaks and prophesies concerning him." "<b>And you shall stumble by day</b> — the meaning is: by day, which is light, as though it were night for you and for the false prophet who seduces you. And this is: 'and the prophet too shall stumble with you by night.'" "<b>And I have destroyed</b> — and I have struck."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:01.816425545Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}